'''Moonlight Cockatrice''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that require level 25 [[Slayer]] to kill, who are found in the Earthbound Cavern within [[Neypotzli]] which requires level 48 [[Slayer]] for partial completion of [[Perilous Moons]] to enter.  Please note that if you have only partially completed [[Perilous Moons]] to access them for a slayer task, they will not re-spawn on their own after being killed. You must leave the room and re-enter before they will re-spawn. Additionally, when using a cannon with the partial completion [[Perilous Moons]], when leaving for them to re-spawn, make sure you pick the cannon up before leaving, otherwise the cannon will be instantly degraded and must be collected from [[Nulodion|Nulodian]] in Falador.

A [[mirror shield]] or [[V's shield]] is required to defend against their piercing gaze, or else they will reduce your combat stats every hit, even while safespotting. Their drops are almost identical to those of the regular [[cockatrice]], only dropping slightly higher quantities of runes, though they provide more [[Slayer]] experience per kill.

They share the same superior as the cockatrice, the [[Cockathrice]].

